Let me introduce you to Ninja Forms.
Ninja Forms are a simple, eloquent, user-friendly free WordPress form plugin that enables you to develop many types of forms like multiple-step forms, file uploads, pdf forms, payments and many more. These are considered one of the most reliable ways in which you can create professional forms.
Let’s go through some excellent features of Ninja Forms- User friendly
Ninja forms provide you with different designs to create such forms. You do not have to be a pro designer.
Want to accept payments and donations from your customers?
Try Ninja Forms for free now!
This is the most basic of all the membership packages because it includes all of the fundamental layouts for creating your forms.
It is generally priced at $199, but the discounted offer is $99.50 and also, it includes everything from the PERSONAL memberships. It can be used with 20 different websites.
It is generally priced at $499, but the discounted offer is $249.50 and it also includes everything from the Professional memberships. It can be used with unlimited websites.
Here you can choose from different Add-ons as you may wish. It can be used with 1-20 sites.
Here are some of the positive points in Ninja forms-
Ninja forms have an excellent drag and drop feature, which is easy to use even for beginners.
You need not buy the entire membership for using ninja forms. You can also access it by purchasing some add-ons separately according to your need.
Here are some of the negative points in Ninja forms-
Ninja forms lack some of the features. For example, if you want to create a customer-based form, then you need to buy add-ons, unlike other forms like Gravity forms offer in the core version of the forms.
Purchasing add-ons seems a good strategy instead of buying the memberships. But, as the need for the forms increase, it happens to be a bit more overpriced than other competitors.
There are various types of forms you could use for your WordPress site. But today, I will be looking at these two types of form builders, which are most frequently used.
While both types of forms have subscription plans, you can have some primary forms functionality from the WordPress repository like the selection of form fields, custom email addresses and more.
Support services are provided from Monday to Friday from 9 am to 4 pm EST.
If you are a paid customer, you will be provided with solutions to your problems in less than 8 hours.
After a lot of research, I have rated WP Ninjas based on features that WP Ninjas is currently offering. You can find below my ratings.
WP Ninjas have come a long way in helping and satisfying their customer’s need to build simple, beautiful, and adaptable forms to develop their WordPress site.
