The effect of fixed interest rate is achieved by holding Long/Short tokens to establish an "opposite position of interest rate change profit and loss".
In order to achieve better liquidity, liquidity providers can increase funds and earn transaction fees and other rewards by purchasing LP tokens.
Fixed interest rates will also become increasingly important as traditional finance tries to adopt DeFi.
In the DeFi space, however, the ratio is completely reversed.
With iGain IRS, crypto users will be able to cover their floating rate positions on these DeFi platforms by buying long and short tokens.Not only does the platform end uncertainty and set cost limits for borrowers, but it also enables lenders to guarantee certain income levels in the event of falling interest rates.
"The reason why interest rate exchange (IRS) can occupy a huge proportion in traditional finance is that only the high capital efficiency brought by "interest rate differential" is deeply favored by enterprises and financial institutions. We learn from the design of interest rate exchange to further Transform the interest rate exchange of traditional finance and create iGain — Interest Rate Synth, an interest rate derivatives trading market suitable for blockchain. "
This is because iGain is essentially a DeFi product that enables various financial targets to be marketed through derivatives, a tool that can market a derivative and unpredictable financial concept.
But anyone in the $HAKKA community can submit new ideas for any iGain financial product. If the community votes for it, those who submit suggestions, will be rewarded.”
