(This article is an extensive editorial, written and provided by YIELD App, and does not represent the position of the dynamic zone.)
On January 2022, 1 (next Tuesday), YIELD App V18 will be officially launched with a series of exciting new features.
In the face of this exciting large-scale update, the community must have some questions. Below we have prepared a series of YIELD App V2 FAQ (Frequently Asked Questions and Answers), hoping to address possible concerns.
How long does it take to upgrade to VXNUMX?
Our users do not need to take any action.All your assets will be automatically and seamlessly migrated during the short maintenance process.
Since all assets will be automatically invested, you do not need to make any withdrawals before or during the upgrade.Plus, to keep your assets safe and reduceEthereum Gas fee, we do not encourage withdrawals during the upgrade period.
What do I need to do after the upgrade?
Whether it is V1 or V2, our users can freely withdraw assets at any time, but the withdrawal fee is charged according to the standard rate.onlyBitcoinPortfolio exceptions have a fixed lock-up period (on February 2022, 2, the lock-up period will be per unit per month).
How do I pledge YLD?
In V2, you can also lock some or all of your YLD tokens for 12 months with a base rate of return of 12% per annum to further increase the APY of your YLD portion.Once you have staked YLD, you can easily complete the locking action on the YLD token page of the new homepage.Unlike the pledged YLD that can be withdrawn at any time, the locked YLD will be locked in the platform for the next 12 months.
Your user level is determined by the sum of your staked and locked YLD on the YIELD App platform, so this combination ratio is based on specific investment situations.For example, 200 YLDs are pledged and 800 YLDs are locked, totaling 1,000 YLDs, that is, silver users.When you earn, or stake/lock more YLD, you will have the opportunity to further increase your user level, in short everything depends on the sum of the YLD you lock or stake.
Note: All rates are subject to periodic review and revision based on market conditions.
Will my user level remain the same after the upgrade?
Through the "Earn" option, you can access each portfolio and select the "Autocompound" option.With this setup, all of your earnings will be automatically invested in this portfolio, resulting in compounding interest (i.e.
Note, however, that if you choose to pay all your earnings in YLD, the local currency invested will not automatically compound.For example, if a user chooses to receive all earnings in YLD in a USDT portfolio, the principal of holding USDT will not increase.
*In the "Earnings" option, you can also use the "Auto-deploy deposits" option to automatically deploy deposits from all wallets to portfolio assets.
Like V1, we will not charge any fees for exchanging assets within the YIELD App platform, and for all our users, we will guarantee that the exchange rate is competitive in the market.
How long is the new BTC lock-up period?
In the latest user-level reward system, we will provide higher yields to users who hold more YLD; Diamond members with 20,000 or more YLD can get the highest basic yield, and the highest YLD yield.The above measures are to ensure that our users can receive corresponding rewards based on their loyalty to the entire YIELD App ecosystem.Diamond users will also receive more benefits over time.
